      "side": 1,
      "message": "Initially I was thinking the same way, in charge_set_mode() to check inhibit bit. But this is not the only place to write to register option 0. Host command charge_command_charge_state() also write to option 0, and it calls charger_set_option() directly. This means inhibit bit can be changed without going through charge_set_mode(). Because of this, I moved the prev_chg_mode outside charger_set_mode().",
